पर्य्-अव-√ सो P. -स्यति, to result or end in, amount to (loc. or acc. with प्रति), Kāv.; Sāh.;
to finish, complete, conclude, include, MW.;
to endeavour, ib.;
to perish, be lost, decline, A.

पर्य्-अव-√ स्था Ā. -तिष्ठते, to become firm or steady, Bhag.;
to fill, pervade (acc.), MBh. :
Caus. -स्थापयति, to comfort, encourage, ib.

पर्य्-√ 1. अस् P. पर्य्-अस्ति, (3. du. प॑रि-ष्टः; 2. pl. प॑रि-ष्ठ; pf. प॑र्य्-आस),
to be in the way of (acc.), RV.;
to pass or spend time, ib.

पर्य्-√ 2. अस् P. Ā. पर्य्-अस्यति, ˚ते, to throw or cast or place round, AV.; AitBr.;
to spread round, diffuse, Kir.;
to entrap, ensnare (Ā. aor. 3. du. पर्य्-आसिषाताम्, Pāṇ. iii, 1, 52, Sch.);
to turn round, wallow (ind.p. पर्य्-अस्य), Amar.;
to throw down, overturn, upset (aor. पर्य्-आस्थत्), ŚBr.; Mn.; Kathās. :
Pass. पर्य्-अस्यते (aor. पर्य्-आस्थत, Pāṇ. iii, 1, 52, Sch.), to tall down, drop:
Caus. पर्य्-आसयति, to cause to roll down or shed (as tears), Ragh.

. sg. -आसीत),
to sit or assemble round any one (acc.), RV.; ŚBr.;
to remain sitting or inactive, RV.;
to sue for (acc.), ib. x, 40, 7.

पर्य्-आ-√ दा Ā. -दत्ते (Pot. -ददीत ind.p. -दाय), to make one's own, take away from (abl.), RV.; Br.;
to take off (any liquid), Suśr.; Car.;
to seize, snatch, MBh.;
to appropriate, learn, MBh.

पर्य्-√ आप् P. -आप्नोति (Impv. -आप्नुहि; pf. -आप),
to reach, obtain, attain, gain, RV.; TS.; ŚBr.;
to make an end of, be content, MBh. :
Caus. -आपयति (ind.p. -आप्य), to perform, do, Rājat. :
Desid. परीप्सति, to wish to obtain or reach, desire, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to wish to preserve, guard, MBh.;
to wish to get at, lie in wait or ambush, ib.

पर्य्-आ-√ वृत् Ā. -व॑र्तते (ep. also ˚ति Pot. -वर्तेत्, Hariv.; pf. -ववर्त, -ववृते, MBh.; aor. पर्य्-आ॑-वर्त्, RV.; ind.p. परि-वृत्य, ĀpŚr.),
to turn round (intrans.; trans. only ind.p.), turn away from (abl.), return to (dat.), RV. &c. &c.;
to be changed into (instr.), Kād.;
to get possessed of (acc.), Hariv. :
Caus. -वर्तयति, to turn or roll round (trans.), TS.; ŚBr.;
to change or barter against (

पर्य्-उप-√ स्था P. -तिष्ठति, to be or stand round (acc.);
to attend, serve, honour with (instr.), MBh.; R.;
 (Ā.) to join, KātyŚr., Sch.

. sg. -उपासीत; impf. 3. sg. -उपासत्),
to sit round, surround, encompass, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to be present at, share in, partake of (acc.), MBh.;
to approach respectfully, attend upon, worship, Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Pass. -उपास्यते, to be attended by (instr.), Ragh. x, 63.

(-आ-√ इ) P. -ऐति (ind.p. ए॑त्य), to roam about, AitBr.;
to go round, circumambulate (acc.), ŚBr.;
to come back, return, ChUp.
